Ben: I think I''m going to study computer science. I really want to build robots.
Amy: That sounds exciting. Robots will probably do many jobs one day.
Ben: Exactly. What about you, Amy? Have you made up your mind?
Amy: Not completely. I''m really interested in clean energy, like solar power.
Ben: That''s a great field. The world will need much more clean energy.
Amy: Yes. My dream is to design batteries that store sunlight.
Ben: Then we should both work hard at science this year.
Amy: Agreed. Let''s prepare for the future together.', 'Amy 问 Ben 将来想做什么;Ben 打算学计算机科学,想造机器人;Amy 还没完全决定,对太阳能等清洁能源很感兴趣,梦想设计储存阳光的电池;两人决定今年都努力学好科学,一起为未来做准备。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Ben plan to study?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Computer science.","Clean energy.","History.","Music."]},{"q":"What does Ben really want to build?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Cars.","Robots.","Houses.","Ships."]},{"q":"Which field is Amy interested in?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Clean energy.","Medicine.","Law.","Cooking."]},{"q":"What is Amy''s dream?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["To become a famous doctor.","To design batteries that store sunlight.","To open a small restaurant.","To travel around the world."]},{"q":"What do the two friends decide to do?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Stop studying for a while.","Change to another school.","Work hard at science together.","Take a long holiday."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective4', 'U1', 'fltrp');
Richard: Good afternoon. I''ve always been interested in travel and meeting new people.
Manager: I see. What did you do during your previous holidays?
Richard: Last year I worked in a youth hostel in Vietnam and helped guests plan their trips.
Manager: That''s useful experience. Why do you think you are suitable for this job?
Richard: I''m a friendly and outgoing person, and I feel happy when I help others.
Manager: Good. Can you work at weekends?
Richard: Yes, weekends are no problem for me at all.
Manager: Wonderful. We''ll let you know our decision by Friday.
Richard: Thank you very much. I look forward to hearing from you.', '经理问 Richard 为何应聘青年旅舍的工作;Richard 说自己一直喜欢旅行和结识新朋友;去年他在越南的青年旅舍工作过,帮客人规划行程;他认为自己友好外向、乐于助人,所以胜任;周末也能上班;经理说周五前给答复。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Where is Richard applying for a job?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["At a youth hostel.","At a hospital.","At a bank.","At a school."]},{"q":"Why did Richard apply for the job?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["He wants to earn a great deal of money.","He is interested in travel and meeting people.","He lives next to the youth hostel.","His parents told him to."]},{"q":"What did Richard do in Vietnam last year?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["He studied at a local university.","He travelled as a tourist only.","He worked in a youth hostel and helped guests.","He taught English to children."]},{"q":"Why does Richard think he is suitable?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["He never makes any mistakes.","He can speak five languages.","He has worked there for years.","He is friendly and enjoys helping others."]},{"q":"When will Richard hear the decision?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["By Friday.","By next month.","The same evening.","In a year''s time."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective4', 'U1', 'fltrp');
Tom: I''m planning to take a gap year before university.
Lily: A gap year? What will you do during that time?
Tom: I''m going to do voluntary work in a village school abroad.
Lily: That sounds meaningful. Won''t you miss a whole year of study?
Tom: Maybe, but the experience will make me more independent and mature.
Lily: That''s true. Where exactly are you going?
Tom: I''ve decided to go to Cambodia and help teach English to children.
Lily: I hope it goes well. You''ll have wonderful stories to share.
Tom: Thanks, Lily. I''m sure it will be a year I never forget.', 'Lily 问 Tom 高中毕业后打算做什么;Tom 计划在上大学前过一个间隔年,去国外乡村学校做志愿工作;虽然会少学一年,但这段经历会让他更独立、更成熟;他决定去柬埔寨教孩子们英语;Lily 祝他顺利,Tom 相信这将是难忘的一年。', 'uk_male', '[{"q":"What is Tom planning to do after senior high?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Start work at a bank.","Stay at home and rest.","Take a gap year.","Go straight to a job abroad."]},{"q":"What kind of work will Tom do?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Building roads in a city.","Selling cars in a shop.","Cooking in a hotel.","Voluntary work in a village school."]},{"q":"Why is Tom willing to take a gap year?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It will make him more independent and mature.","It will help him earn lots of money.","He wants to avoid going to university.","His friends are all doing the same."]},{"q":"Where has Tom decided to go?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Vietnam.","Cambodia.","France.","Australia."]},{"q":"What will Tom do there?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Study physics at a college.","Drive a school bus.","Help teach English to children.","Build a new hospital."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective4', 'U1', 'fltrp');

-- ===== 6) 写作 1篇 =====
DELETE FROM public.junior_writing_prompts WHERE publisher='fltrp' AND volume='elective4' AND unit='U1';

I am writing to apply for the position of a part-time tour guide, as advertised on our school website. As I plan to work in the tourism industry one day, I would welcome this opportunity.

I know almost every corner of my home city and have a real passion for its history. I can also speak English fluently, which will help me serve foreign visitors well. Last summer, I organised a tour of the old town for some exchange students, and they gave me very warm feedback.

I would be delighted to discuss my application further. You can reach me at lihua@email.com.

Yours faithfully,
Li Hua', '【15 分制】A 档(13-15):五要素齐全、组织有条理、语言准确多样;B 档(10-12):要点较全、少量错误;C 档(7-9):要点偏少、句型简单;D 档(0-6):内容不完整、错误多。', '["I am writing to apply for the position of a part-time tour guide, as advertised on our school website.","I know almost every corner of my home city and have a real passion for its history.","Last summer, I organised a tour of the old town for some exchange students.","I would be delighted to discuss my application further."]'::jsonb, '[{"wrong":"I am writing to apply the position.","correct":"I am writing to apply for the position.","note":"apply for sth 固定搭配,不可漏 for。"},{"wrong":"Last summer I organise a tour for students.","correct":"Last summer I organised a tour for students.","note":"Last summer 表过去,谓语用一般过去时。"},{"wrong":"I will welcome the opportunity to discussing it.","correct":"I would welcome the opportunity to discuss it.","note":"婉转表愿望用 would;opportunity to do sth 后接动词原形。"}]'::jsonb, '【兼职求职信结构】
称呼:Dear Sir or Madam,
第1段 目的:I am writing to apply for the position of … as advertised on …
第2段 优势+经历:I know … well and can … . Last summer, I organised … .
第3段 结尾:I would be delighted to discuss my application further. You can reach me at … .
落款:Yours faithfully, Li Hua', 2, 'elective4', 'U1', 'fltrp');

